<span id="S7.T5.5.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.T5.5.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The response is mapped to ‘False’ because it unequivocally and explicitly states that the claim is False. Phrases like “There is no evidence”, “not supported by scientific evidence” and “debunked” clearly refute the claim, leaving no room for ambiguity.</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
